{
  "title": "STS / SCP · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "STS의 임시 권한 사용과 SCP의 조직 권한 제한을 구분합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>STS <span class=\"full-name\">(Security Token Service)</span> / SCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Service Control Policy)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#guide-1\">역할을 맡아 임시로 접근하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#guide-2\">조직의 계정 사용 범위 제한</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>보안</span><span>54 / 62</span></div><h1>STS <span class=\"full-name\">(Security Token Service)</span> / SCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Service Control Policy)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>STS는 <strong>유효기간이 있는 AWS 자격 증명을 발급하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 사람이 다른 계정의 역할을 맡거나 애플리케이션이 일정 시간 동안 필요한 권한을 사용할 때 활용합니다.</p><p>SCP는 <strong>여러 AWS 계정에서 사용할 수 있는 권한의 최대 범위를 제한하는 조직 정책</strong>입니다. STS가 권한을 임시로 사용하는 방법이라면 SCP는 조직 차원의 사용 경계를 정합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"assumerole\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"assumerolewithsaml-and-assumerolewithwebidentity\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"external-id-and-confused-deputy\"></span><h2>역할을 맡아 임시로 접근하기</h2><p>역할의 신뢰 정책은 누가 역할을 맡을 수 있는지 정하고, 권한 정책은 맡은 뒤 무엇을 할 수 있는지 정합니다. STS의 AssumeRole로 역할을 맡으면 임시 자격 증명을 받습니다.</p><p>다른 계정의 역할을 사용하는 경우 요청자의 허용과 대상 역할의 신뢰 관계를 함께 설정합니다. 외부 업체에 역할을 제공할 때는 External ID 등의 조건도 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"session-duration-tags-and-source-identity\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"organizations-and-organizational-units\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"service-control-policies\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"allow-lists-and-deny-lists\"></span><h2>조직의 계정 사용 범위 제한</h2><p>AWS Organizations<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>에서 계정이나 조직 단위에 SCP를 적용할 수 있습니다. 예를 들어 특정 리전의 사용을 제한하거나 중요한 보안 기능을 끄지 못하게 할 수 있습니다.</p><p>SCP 자체가 사용자에게 작업 권한을 부여하는 것은 아닙니다. SCP가 허용하는 범위 안에서 IAM 정책으로 실제 권한을 부여합니다. 적용 대상 계정과 서비스 연결 역할 등의 예외도 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>조직과 역할의 권한 구성</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ul class=\"concept-flow concept-comparison\"><li><strong>SCP</strong><span>계정의 사용 가능 범위</span></li><li><strong>IAM 역할</strong><span>신뢰 관계·실제 권한</span></li><li><strong>STS 세션</strong><span>유효기간 동안 권한 사용</span></li></ul><p class=\"diagram-note\">각 요소는 같은 요청의 권한 범위를 서로 다른 관점에서 구성합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>운영 계정에서만 배포 역할을 사용할 수 있도록 신뢰 관계를 만들고, 조직 SCP로 허용하지 않는 리전의 리소스 생성을 제한합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>AWS Organizations</strong> — 여러 AWS 계정을 하나의 조직으로 묶어 계정 생성, 정책 적용, 통합 결제 등을 관리하는 서비스입니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_credentials_temp.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Temporary security credentials in IAM ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/organizations/latest/userguide/orgs_manage_policies_scps.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service control policies (SCPs) ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q062/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q062\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q062\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q062</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q062/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A principal needs temporary access by assuming a role in another AWS account. Which API action is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 HealthCheck</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">STS AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only S3 PutObject</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EC2 AssociateAddress</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · AssumeRole은 역할의 임시 자격 증명을 얻는다. 양측 권한·신뢰 설정을 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q063\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q063\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q063</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q063/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An IAM role policy allows an API action in a member account, but an organization SCP blocks that action. What is the result?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q063\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q063\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The IAM Allow takes precedence</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q063\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q063\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The action is denied by the SCP restriction</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>는 최대 권한 경계다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>의 Allow만으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>의 제한을 넘을 수 없다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2,4\" data-question=\"Q089\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q089\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q089</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q089/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to use a role to access an S3 bucket in another account. Which TWO permission areas should it review?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q089\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only NAT gateway availability</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q089\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q089\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The role trust policy and permission to call AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q089\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the EC2 instance size</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q089\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The target bucket policy and the role's S3 permissions</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C, E</strong> · 교차 계정 역할을 맡을 수 있어야 하고, 맡은 뒤 리소스 액세스 정책도 맞아야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q061\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q061\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q061</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q061/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application on EC2 needs S3 access. Instead of embedding a long-term access key in the AMI, what should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q061\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Embed the root account key</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q061\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Make the S3 bucket public</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q061\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an IAM role to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q061\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow all traffic in the network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 역할을 통한 임시 자격 증명과 최소 권한 정책이 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q068\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q068\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q068</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q068/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An administrator needs to audit who called an API to change an IAM policy. Which service should be checked first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The size of files in EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch CPU metrics</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>은 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 활동 이력을 기록한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">이전 용어 <b>Storage Gateway</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">다음 용어 <b>Subnet / CIDR</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
